                <p>Source: Department of State, Central Files, 794.5/12–1459. Confidential;
                    Priority; Limit Distribution. Drafted by Sneider on December 17; cleared with
                    S/S, L/FE, and OSD/ISA; and approved by Parsons. Repeated to CINCPAC and
                    COMUS/Japan.</p>
